Intent backing file for the NEGATIVE corpus.

Every fixture in this directory points its @source lines here so that the
@source existence check resolves and cannot mask the ONE defect the fixture
is meant to isolate. Line 1 is the title above; lines 2..N below are the
targets the fixtures reference.

1. An invoice has an amount.
2. A rule decides something about an invoice.
3. A second rule composes with the first.
4. A third rule, when a fixture needs one.
5. Spare.
6. Spare.
7. Spare.
8. Spare.
